WEBVTT

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.010
What's with Yuuko?

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.780
She can't stand that habit you have. {hates that h of yours}

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:17.740
Why?

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.360
Her friends told her that you're the only one 
who does something that gross.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.020
You heard that from her yourself? {she said that, to you?}{did y tell u that}

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:25.540
Yeah.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Hmm...

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.300
That's not like her. {how unusual}

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:50.440
Hey, Onii-chan, what's that?
 Where's all that smoke coming from?

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.520
Onii-chan, let me look too.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.860
Come on, Onii-chan!

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:57.120
Isn't this bad? {alt}

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:00.060
Isn't Sonohara Base in that direction?

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.710
On screen: "Forest fire on outskirts of Sonohara Base?"

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:17.490
I repeat, the explosion at Sonohara base...

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:21.890
Suizenji Kunihiro is moving out! {setting out at once}

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:27.400
Each and every time I'm tested by sadness,

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:27.400
Kanashimi ni tamesareru tabi

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:33.300
I become just a little bit stronger.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:33.300
sukoshi zutsu tsuyoku natteku

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:39.060
Even as I live this mundane life,

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:39.060
Arifureta mainichi no naka

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:49.270
I keep chasing the endings of my dreams.

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:49.270
yume no tsuzuki oikakete

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:53.380
Iriya's Sky

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:53.380
Summer of UFOs

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:57.760
Iriya's Sky

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:57.760
Summer of UFOs

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:02.240
Tired of walking, I looked up to the sky...

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:02.240
Aruki tsukarete miageta sora

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:07.710
...and saw a deep blue that went on without end. {fi, fo}

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:07.710
Fukaku dokomademo BLUE

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:14.530
It completely engulfed my minute self, {sc, link}

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:14.530
Chippoke na jibun dakishimete

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:18.230
 but I still had to move forward. {link, fo}

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:18.230
Soredemo susundeku

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:24.830
I miss you so much

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:24.830
Anata ni aitai

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.880
and wish I could share my smile with you. {sc, sc ln}

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.880
Egao wo tsutaetai

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:36.020
Because you are here with me, {sc ln, sc ln}

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:36.020
Anata ga iru kara

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:40.910
a light is born between us. {link, fo}

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:40.910
Hikari ga umareru no

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:48.680
I send a longing, wistful melody... {fi, link}

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:48.680
Harukanaru yasashii shirabe

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:54.290
...into and beyond the far-off skies. {link, link}

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:54.290
Tooi sora koete todoku no

00:02:54.290 --> 00:03:00.120
And the depths of my heart fill up... {link, link}

00:02:54.290 --> 00:03:00.120
Mune no oku kakegae no nai

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:10.210
...with an irreplaceable and sweet agony.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:10.210
Amai itami michite yuku

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:19.970
